4. PRIVACY POLICY & TELEMETRY CONSENT
This software performs local, read-only system integrity diagnostics on the user's personal computer to detect game modifications, injected DLLs, and cheat execution traces. Diagnostic reports containing anonymized hardware hashes (HWID), process names, and scan flags are uploaded securely to official Sunveil SMP servers (`cheat.sunveil.net`). No private personal files, personal documents, credentials, or sensitive user data are collected or transmitted.

